Z||000000||FieroMontreal||12-06-2001||10:50 PM||||Hey guys<BR>Fiero Montreal is having an x-mas party on Sunday December 9th 2001 at 5pm. We will be meeting at the Nobel 82 Restaurant in Chateauguay. For directions please check out this link : <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com/eng/events.php?event=xmas.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieromontreal.com/eng/events.php?event=xmas.htm</A> <P>We are having a gift exchange so if you want to show up each person must bring a gift of $5 or under! You must reserve your spot! <P>Thanks!<P>*This was also posted in the General Forum.<P>------------------<BR> -Alex <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">   <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
